{{!--
    Curator loot announcement.

    Announcement only. The Loot button that used to live here was the Phase 1 entry
    point, from before Blacksmith's token interaction registry existed; double-click
    now covers it properly and honours proximity and combat, which a chat button
    could only report after the fact.

    Blacksmith's card classes are reused deliberately so this matches every other
    Coffee Pub chat card. There is no styling API for chat cards.
--}}
<span style="visibility: hidden">coffeepub-hide-header</span>
<div class="blacksmith-card theme-default curator-loot-card">
    <div class="card-header">
        <i class="fas fa-coins"></i> Loot Dropped!
    </div>
    <div class="section-content">
        <p>{{tokenName}} has been defeated and dropped their belongings!</p>
    </div>
</div>
